# Diagram Template

Purpose:
  Architecture diagram requirements for every API implementation.
  Shows data flow, entry point, dependencies, and fallback paths.

Owns: architecture\DIAGRAM-TEMPLATE.sdd

## Diagram Structure

Type: why-how-what diagram

Required_Elements:
  - Entry point (API route / trigger)
  - Data flow (request → processing → response)
  - Dependencies (DB, external services, internal modules)
  - Fallback paths (error handling, defaults, degradation)

## Storage

Location: Stored alongside the CASE spec.
Format: Mermaid diagram-as-code per documentation.diagram_standard.
Overlay: Docker icons where applicable.
Legend: Academic-style legend and explanatory notes.

## Example Structure

Example:
  ```mermaid
  graph TD
    A[Client] --> B{API Gateway}
    B --> C[Service Layer]
    C --> D[(Database)]
    C --> E[External API]
    E -->|fallback| F[Cache]
  ```

State: +
